{%- comment -%}
  Carosello con slide miste: i prodotti di una collezione, singoli prodotti e immagini con testo, nell'ordine dei blocchi.
  Codice originale con API native: dagli esempi "Carousel" di Motion+ solo le idee.

  - Scorrimento nativo (scroll-snap): senza JS la traccia si scorre comunque, frecce e paginazione non compaiono.
  - Larghezze in cqw sul contenitore: stessa griglia della pagina (--carousel-content) anche con il carosello a tutta
    larghezza, dove le slide escono dalla griglia solo verso destra.
  - Le immagini con testo hanno un'altezza minima dalle proporzioni scelte, calcolata su una slide normale anche per
    quelle doppie (elemento [aria-hidden]), e si allungano con la riga: accanto alle card prodotto restano allineate.
  - shopify:product:view: lo emette product-card quando la card entra nello schermo. Contesto `collection` anche per i
    prodotti singoli: il campo è obbligatorio e questo è il valore previsto per una card in un elenco.
  - Blocchi senza contenuto: nel negozio spariscono; nell'editor resta un segnaposto.
  JS: frontend/entrypoints/carousel.js; effetti e barra: frontend/entrypoints/carousel-effects.js (solo se usati).
  Slide immagine con testo: snippets/carousel-image-slide.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'section-colors', section_id: section.id, scheme: section.settings.color_scheme %}
{%- liquid
  # Base dei sizes: non accetta var() (snippets/section-width.liquid)
  assign page_max = settings.layout_page_width | append: 'px'
  assign s = section.settings
  assign track_id = 'Carousel-' | append: section.id
  assign quick_view_id = 'QuickView-' | append: section.id

  assign has_slides = false
  assign has_products = false
  for block in section.blocks
    case block.type
      when 'collection'
        if block.settings.collection.products_count > 0
          assign has_slides = true
          assign has_products = true
        endif
      when 'product'
        if block.settings.product != blank
          assign has_slides = true
          assign has_products = true
        endif
      when 'image'
        if block.settings.image != blank or block.settings.heading != blank or block.settings.text != blank
          assign has_slides = true
        endif
    endcase
  endfor

  assign use_quick_view = false
  if s.quick_view and has_products
    assign use_quick_view = true
  endif

  assign effect = s.effect
  assign align = s.slide_align
  if effect == 'coverflow'
    assign align = 'center'
  endif

  assign per_view = s.per_view_desktop
  assign per_view_md = per_view | at_most: 3
  assign per_view_mobile = s.per_view_mobile

  capture sizes
    echo '(min-width: 990px) calc((min(100vw, ' | append: page_max | append: ') - 3rem) / ' | append: per_view | append: '), (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 3rem) / ' | append: per_view_md | append: '), calc((100vw - 3rem) / ' | append: per_view_mobile | append: ')'
  endcapture
  comment
    Card prodotto: larghezza esatta della slide, spazi tra le slide compresi (--carousel-slide). Senza gli spazi, 4 card
    in una pagina da 1280px erano 308px invece di 296: con DPR 2 scaricavano 800 invece di 600. Le slide immagine
    tengono `sizes` / `sizes_wide`: object-cover e l'effetto parallax (scale 1.15) mostrano la foto più grande della
    slide, quindi il margine in più non è uno spreco.
  endcomment
  assign gaps_lg = per_view | minus: 1 | times: s.gap
  assign gaps_md = per_view_md | minus: 1 | times: s.gap
  assign gaps_sm = per_view_mobile | times: 10 | round | minus: 10 | times: s.gap | divided_by: 10.0
  capture card_sizes
    echo '(min-width: 990px) calc((min(100vw, ' | append: page_max | append: ') - 3rem - ' | append: gaps_lg | append: 'px) / ' | append: per_view | append: '), (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 3rem - ' | append: gaps_md | append: 'px) / ' | append: per_view_md | append: '), calc((100vw - 3rem - ' | append: gaps_sm | append: 'px) / ' | append: per_view_mobile | append: ')'
  endcapture
  capture sizes_wide
    echo '(min-width: 990px) calc((min(100vw, ' | append: page_max | append: ') - 3rem) * 2 / ' | append: per_view | append: '), (min-width: 750px) calc((100vw - 3rem) * 2 / ' | append: per_view_md | append: '), calc((100vw - 3rem) / ' | append: per_view_mobile | append: ')'
  endcapture

  assign slide_class = 'w-(--carousel-slide) shrink-0'
  if align == 'center'
    assign slide_class = slide_class | append: ' snap-center'
  else
    assign slide_class = slide_class | append: ' snap-start'
  endif

  assign width_class = 'mx-auto max-w-page'
  if s.width == 'full'
    assign width_class = ''
  endif

  assign snap_class = 'snap-x snap-mandatory data-dragging:snap-none'
  if s.scroll_mode == 'free'
    assign snap_class = ''
  endif

  assign track_padding_class = 'py-1 -my-1'
  # Coverflow e ombra delle card prodotto: la fila scorre e taglierebbe ciò che esce in verticale
  if effect == 'coverflow' or settings.product_card_shadow != 'none'
    assign track_padding_class = 'py-6 -my-6'
  endif

  case s.slide_ratio
    when 'square'
      assign ratio_class = 'aspect-square'
    when 'landscape'
      assign ratio_class = 'aspect-4/3'
    when 'wide'
      assign ratio_class = 'aspect-square md:aspect-video'
    else
      assign ratio_class = 'aspect-4/5'
  endcase

  assign list_label = s.heading
  if s.heading == blank
    assign list_label = 'sections.carousel.label' | t
  endif

  assign show_pagination = false
  if s.pagination != 'none'
    assign show_pagination = true
  endif

  # Riga dei comandi. Con le frecce ai lati, da 750px sotto restano solo indicatore e pausa
  assign side_arrows = false
  if s.show_arrows and s.arrows_position == 'sides'
    assign side_arrows = true
  endif
  assign row_class = 'justify-between'
  unless s.show_arrows or s.autoplay
    assign row_class = 'justify-center'
  endunless
  unless show_pagination
    assign row_class = 'justify-end'
  endunless
  if side_arrows and s.autoplay == false
    if show_pagination
      assign row_class = 'justify-between md:justify-center'
    else
      assign row_class = 'justify-end md:hidden'
    endif
  endif

  assign arrow_class = 'button button-neutral button-icon'

  # Solo la prima schermata della prima section è caricata subito, e solo la sua prima immagine ha la priorità
  assign slide_index = 0
-%}

{%- if has_slides or request.design_mode -%}
  <carousel-slider
    class="group/carousel block py-8 md:py-16"
    data-align="{{ align }}"
    data-scroll="{{ s.scroll_mode }}"
    {% if effect != 'none' %}
      data-effect="{{ effect }}"
    {% endif %}
    {% if s.autoplay %}
      data-autoplay="{{ s.autoplay_interval }}"
    {% endif %}
    {% if use_quick_view %}
      data-quick-view="{{ quick_view_id }}"
    {% endif %}
  >
    {%- if s.heading != blank or s.intro != blank -%}
      <div class="page-width mb-8 md:mb-12">
        {% render 'section-header', heading: s.heading, intro: s.intro, align: s.align %}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div
      class="@container {{ width_class }} [--carousel-n:var(--per-view-sm)] md:[--carousel-n:var(--per-view-md)] lg:[--carousel-n:var(--per-view-lg)]"
      style="
        --per-view-sm: {{ per_view_mobile }};
        --per-view-md: {{ per_view_md }};
        --per-view-lg: {{ per_view }};
        --carousel-gap: {{ s.gap }}px;
        --carousel-content: calc(min(100cqw, var(--container-page)) - 3rem);
        --carousel-slide: calc((var(--carousel-content) - (var(--carousel-n) - 1) * var(--carousel-gap)) / var(--carousel-n));
        --carousel-inset: calc((100cqw - {% if align == 'center' %}var(--carousel-slide){% else %}var(--carousel-content){% endif %}) / 2);
      "
    >
      <div class="relative">
        <ul
          id="{{ track_id }}"
          class="relative flex gap-(--carousel-gap) overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain px-(--carousel-inset) scroll-px-(--carousel-inset) [scrollbar-width:thin] js:[scrollbar-width:none] js:cursor-grab group-data-static/carousel:cursor-auto! data-dragging:cursor-grabbing! data-dragging:select-none {{ snap_class }} {{ track_padding_class }}"
          role="list"
          data-carousel-track
          data-scroll-region
          aria-label="{{ list_label | escape }}"
          {% unless section.index == 1 or effect == 'coverflow' %}
            data-animate-stagger="fade-up"
            data-animate-interval="0.05"
          {% endunless %}
        >
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            {%- case block.type -%}
              {%- when 'collection' -%}
                {%- assign collection_block = block.settings.collection -%}
                {%- if collection_block.products_count > 0 -%}
                  {%- for product in collection_block.products limit: block.settings.limit -%}
                    {%- liquid
                      assign slide_index = slide_index | plus: 1
                      assign card_id = block.id | append: '-' | append: product.id
                      assign card_loading = 'lazy'
                      assign card_priority = 'auto'
                      if section.index == 1 and slide_index <= per_view
                        assign card_loading = 'eager'
                        if slide_index == 1
                          assign card_priority = 'high'
                        endif
                      endif
                    -%}
                    <li
                      class="{{ slide_class }}"
                      {% if forloop.first %}
                        {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {% render 'product-card',
                        product: product,
                        card_id: card_id,
                        sizes: card_sizes,
                        loading: card_loading,
                        fetchpriority: card_priority,
                        quick_view: use_quick_view
                      %}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.show_view_all -%}
                    {%- assign slide_index = slide_index | plus: 1 -%}
                    <li class="{{ slide_class }}">
                      <a
                        href="{{ collection_block.url }}"
                        class="group/all flex h-full min-h-48 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface p-6 text-center text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 ease-theme hover:bg-surface-hover focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
                      >
                        <span class="text-subheading font-semibold text-balance">
                          {{- 'sections.carousel.view_all' | t: name: collection_block.title | escape -}}
                        </span>
                        {% render 'icon',
                          name: 'arrow-right',
                          size: 20,
                          class: 'transition-transform duration-200 ease-theme motion-safe:group-hover/all:translate-x-1'
                        %}
                      </a>
                    </li>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
                  {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
                    {%- assign slide_index = slide_index | plus: 1 -%}
                    <li
                      class="{{ slide_class }}"
                      {% if forloop.first %}
                        {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {% render 'product-card', sizes: card_sizes %}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                {%- endif -%}

              {%- when 'product' -%}
                {%- if block.settings.product != blank or request.design_mode -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign slide_index = slide_index | plus: 1
                    assign card_loading = 'lazy'
                    assign card_priority = 'auto'
                    if section.index == 1 and slide_index <= per_view
                      assign card_loading = 'eager'
                      if slide_index == 1
                        assign card_priority = 'high'
                      endif
                    endif
                  -%}
                  <li class="{{ slide_class }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
                    {% render 'product-card',
                      product: block.settings.product,
                      card_id: block.id,
                      sizes: card_sizes,
                      loading: card_loading,
                      fetchpriority: card_priority,
                      quick_view: use_quick_view
                    %}
                  </li>
                {%- endif -%}

              {%- when 'image' -%}
                {%- assign b = block.settings -%}
                {%- if b.image != blank or b.heading != blank or b.text != blank or request.design_mode -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign slide_index = slide_index | plus: 1
                    assign image_loading = 'lazy'
                    assign image_priority = 'auto'
                    if section.index == 1 and slide_index <= per_view
                      assign image_loading = 'eager'
                      if slide_index == 1
                        assign image_priority = 'high'
                      endif
                    endif
                  -%}
                  {% render 'carousel-image-slide',
                    block: block,
                    slide_class: slide_class,
                    ratio_class: ratio_class,
                    align: align,
                    per_view: per_view,
                    effect: effect,
                    sizes: sizes,
                    sizes_wide: sizes_wide,
                    loading: image_loading,
                    fetchpriority: image_priority
                  %}
                {%- endif -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>

        {%- if side_arrows -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="{{ arrow_class }} absolute top-1/2 start-[max(0.5rem,calc(var(--carousel-inset)_-_1.375rem))] z-20 hidden -translate-y-1/2 shadow-200 md:js:inline-flex group-data-static/carousel:hidden!"
            aria-controls="{{ track_id }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.previous' | t }}"
            aria-disabled="true"
            data-carousel-previous
          >
            {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-left', size: 20 %}
          </button>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="{{ arrow_class }} absolute top-1/2 end-[max(0.5rem,calc(var(--carousel-inset)_-_1.375rem))] z-20 hidden -translate-y-1/2 shadow-200 md:js:inline-flex group-data-static/carousel:hidden!"
            aria-controls="{{ track_id }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.next' | t }}"
            data-carousel-next
          >
            {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right', size: 20 %}
          </button>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Riga dei comandi: spazio riservato dall'inizio con JS, così la comparsa non sposta la pagina {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if s.show_arrows or show_pagination or s.autoplay -%}
        <div class="mx-auto mt-6 hidden min-h-6 w-(--carousel-content) max-w-full items-center gap-4 js:flex group-data-static/carousel:hidden! {{ row_class }}">
          {%- case s.pagination -%}
            {%- when 'dots', 'scaling_dots' -%}
              <div
                class="flex items-center"
                data-carousel-dots
                {% if s.pagination == 'scaling_dots' %}
                  data-scaling
                {% endif %}
              ></div>
              <template data-carousel-dot-template>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="group/dot flex size-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary"
                  aria-controls="{{ track_id }}"
                  aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.page' | t: page: '__page__', total: '__total__' | escape }}"
                >
                  <span class="block size-2 scale-(--dot-scale,1) rounded-full bg-foreground/50 transition-[scale,background-color] duration-200 ease-theme group-hover/dot:bg-foreground group-aria-[current=true]/dot:bg-foreground motion-reduce:transition-none"></span>
                </button>
              </template>
              <p class="text-body-sm text-foreground/80 tabular-nums" aria-hidden="true" data-carousel-count hidden>
                <span data-carousel-current>1</span> / <span data-carousel-total>{{ slide_index }}</span>
              </p>
            {%- when 'count' -%}
              <p class="text-body-sm text-foreground/80 tabular-nums" aria-hidden="true" data-carousel-count>
                <span data-carousel-current>1</span> / <span data-carousel-total>{{ slide_index }}</span>
              </p>
            {%- when 'progress' -%}
              <div class="h-1 max-w-64 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-foreground/15" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="h-full origin-left rounded-full bg-foreground" data-carousel-progress></div>
              </div>
          {%- endcase -%}

          {%- if s.autoplay or s.show_arrows -%}
            <div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2" data-carousel-actions>
              {%- if s.autoplay -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="{{ arrow_class }}"
                  aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.pause' | t }}"
                  data-label-pause="{{ 'sections.carousel.pause' | t }}"
                  data-label-play="{{ 'sections.carousel.play' | t }}"
                  data-carousel-toggle
                  hidden
                >
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'pause', size: 20, class: 'group-data-paused/carousel:hidden' %}
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'play', size: 20, class: 'hidden group-data-paused/carousel:block' %}
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if s.show_arrows -%}
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="{{ arrow_class }}{% if side_arrows %} md:hidden{% endif %}"
                  aria-controls="{{ track_id }}"
                  aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.previous' | t }}"
                  aria-disabled="true"
                  data-carousel-previous
                >
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-left', size: 20 %}
                </button>
                <button
                  type="button"
                  class="{{ arrow_class }}{% if side_arrows %} md:hidden{% endif %}"
                  aria-controls="{{ track_id }}"
                  aria-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.next' | t }}"
                  data-carousel-next
                >
                  {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-right', size: 20 %}
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p class="sr-only" aria-live="polite" data-carousel-status data-label="{{ 'sections.carousel.page' | t: page: '__page__', total: '__total__' | escape }}"></p>
    </div>

    {%- if has_slides == false -%}
      <p class="page-width mt-6 text-center text-body-sm text-foreground/80">{{ 'sections.carousel.editor_empty' | t }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </carousel-slider>

  {%- if use_quick_view -%}
    {% render 'quick-view', id: quick_view_id, section_index: section.index %}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if effect != 'none' or s.pagination == 'progress' -%}
    {% render 'vite-tag-deferred', entry: 'carousel-effects.js', section_index: section.index %}
  {%- endif -%}
  {% render 'vite-tag-deferred', entry: 'carousel.js', section_index: section.index %}
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.carousel.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-carousel",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": [
      "header",
      "footer"
    ]
  },
  "max_blocks": 16,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.heading.label",
      "default": "t:sections.carousel.settings.heading.default"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.intro.label"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "align",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.align.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "start",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.align.options.start"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.align.options.center"
        }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.carousel.settings.header_1.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "per_view_desktop",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_desktop.label",
      "info": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_desktop.info",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 6,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "per_view_mobile",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_mobile.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "1",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_mobile.options.1"
        },
        {
          "value": "1.2",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_mobile.options.1_2"
        },
        {
          "value": "2",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.per_view_mobile.options.2"
        }
      ],
      "default": "1.2"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "gap",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.gap.label",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 32,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "t:sections.carousel.settings.gap.unit",
      "default": 16
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "width",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.width.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "page",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.width.options.page"
        },
        {
          "value": "full",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.width.options.full"
        }
      ],
      "default": "page"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "slide_align",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_align.label",
      "info": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_align.info",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "start",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_align.options.start"
        },
        {
          "value": "center",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_align.options.center"
        }
      ],
      "default": "start"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "scroll_mode",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.scroll_mode.label",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "snap",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.scroll_mode.options.snap"
        },
        {
          "value": "free",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.scroll_mode.options.free"
        }
      ],
      "default": "snap"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "slide_ratio",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.label",
      "info": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.info",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "portrait",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.options.portrait"
        },
        {
          "value": "square",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.options.square"
        },
        {
          "value": "landscape",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.options.landscape"
        },
        {
          "value": "wide",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.slide_ratio.options.wide"
        }
      ],
      "default": "portrait"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "quick_view",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.quick_view.label",
      "info": "t:sections.carousel.settings.quick_view.info",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:sections.carousel.settings.header_2.content"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_arrows",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.show_arrows.label",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "arrows_position",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.arrows_position.label",
      "info": "t:sections.carousel.settings.arrows_position.info",
      "visible_if": "{{ section.settings.show_arrows }}",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "bottom",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.arrows_position.options.bottom"
        },
        {
          "value": "sides",
          "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.arrows_position.options.sides"
        }
      ],
      "default": "bottom"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "pagination",
      "label": "t:sections.carousel.settings.pagination.label",
      "options": [
